@siso/navigation 0.1.0
Copyright (c) 2026 SISO

SISO-authored implementation. Behavior and appearance informed by SISO-owned:
- app/src/components/SideNav.tsx: grouped disclosure rows, active ancestors, counts, collapsed navigation.
- app/src/components/AppShell.tsx: mobile menu, collapse control, breadcrumbs/page navigation.
- app/src/kitv1/siso/app-frame.tsx: workspace selection, tool strip and rail behavior.

Source app-frame uses shadcn sidebar (MIT), but this package does not copy that
sidebar implementation or any third-party component source. Native HTML controls
are independently implemented here. No HALO, Arc Pro, Kobra or Kinetics code is
included. Consumer-provided icons retain the consumer's own licence obligations.

Source-faithful Hub navigation addition:
src/hub/HubSideNav.tsx extracts the original SideNav.tsx presentation;
src/hub/NavGlyph.tsx, navIcons.tsx and icons/ retain the original Hub glyph
mapping/animation implementations, adapted only to package-relative imports.
src/hub/animated/* copies the source's referenced lucide-animated icons.
assets/siso-mark.png is the SISO-owned mark from app/src/assets/siso-mark.png.
hub.css preserves relevant source index.css declarations inside a nav scope.
The earlier generic implementation notice applies only to src/navigation.tsx.

